 class="btn"
 href="/bot/${bot.id}/force-join"
>
بازگشت
</a>

</div>
`,
          req
        )
      );
    }

    const duplicate =
      bot.forceJoins.some(
        x =>
          x.username.toLowerCase() ===
          parsed.username.toLowerCase()
      );

    if (duplicate) {
      return res.send(
        page(
          "خطا",
